      "text": "IDF: The IDF eliminated the Head of the Hamas terrorist network in southern Syria\n\nOvernight (Friday), following IDF intelligence, the IAF struck and eliminated the terrorist Ahmad Muhammad Fahd, Head of the Hamas terrorist network in southern Syria.\n\nAhmad Muhammad Fahd was responsible for carrying out terror attacks against IDF troops and the State of Israel from the area of southern Syria, including firing projectiles toward the Golan Heights area.\n\nThe terrorist was eliminated while planning to carry out an imminent terror attack.\n\nThe IDF is continuing to operate to eliminate Hamas terrorists, wherever they might be."
    }
